/A 1009 0 R
/StructParent 57
/Contents (Nisha Ramayya works across poetry, criticism, andcollaborative performance, and teaches creativewriting. She is the author of two poetrycollections, States of the Body Produced by Love\(Ignota 2019; reissued by Spiral House Editions in2025\) and Fantasia \(Granta, 2024\), as well as theco-authored pamphlets Threads and Siblings,among other publications. She is Senior Lecturerin Creative Writing at Queen Mary, University ofLondon.)
>>
endobj
