/E (Welcome to the BAMS/MSA Joint Conference in Loughborough! We're pleased to host you on Teams for these virtual sessions. You can find further information about the in-person programme here. Thank you for taking part in this online programme, which enriches our exploration of the works and study of Modernism as strange, queer, uncanny, occult, and above all, weird. )
