1215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 353 0 R
/E (Nisha Ramayya works across poetry, criticism, and collaborative performance, and teaches creative writing. She is the author of two poetry collections, States of the Body Produced by Love \(Ignota 2019; reissued by Spiral House Editions in 2025\) and Fantasia \(Granta, 2024\), as well as the co-authored pamphlets Threads and Siblings, among other publications. She is Senior Lecturer in Creative Writing at Queen Mary, University of London.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [790 0 R]
>>
